@baseUrl = http://localhost:51180

### Add a product with stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/db-products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Partial Repository Example",
  "price": 19.99,
  "stock": 5,
  "sku": "PARTIAL-REPO-001"
}

### Count products with stock using the custom partial repository method
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/db-products/in-stock/count
